  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAIIA &#xE4;r ett forsknings- och kunskapsinstitut baserat i Johannesburg, Sydafrika. Det fr&#xE4;mjar uth&#xE5;llig utveckling, ekonomisk integration, god samh&#xE4;llsstyrning, samt fred och s&#xE4;kerhet i Afrika. SAIIA erh&#xE5;ller organisatoriskt st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The South African Institute of International Affairs, SAIIA, is a research and knowledge institute based in Johannesburg, South Africa. It promotes sustainable development, economic integration, good governance, security and peace in Africa. SAIIA receives core support from Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
